<title>USA: Spinnaker Industries Inc Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Spinnaker Industries Inc Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.03     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss		     167     loss	   216</p>
<p> Revs			62,114		   25,070</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,149		    5,432</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.05   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		   353   profit	   471</p>
<p> Revs		     184,358		   77,716</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,959		    6,761</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Avg shares adjusted to reflect 3-for-2 stock split December 29, 1995 and a stock dividend on August 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Results include operations of Central Products Co Inc from October 4, 1995.</p>
<p>1996 nine month period includes a $375,000 charge for a loan guarantee, resulting from the Central products acquisition.</p>
<p>1995 nine month period includes a gain from a reversal of valuation allowances related to net deferred tax assets.</p>
